    "name": {
      "value": "Wand of Toxic Blades (7th-level Spell)"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "tv"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "This slender metal wand is tinted green and small images of bladed weapons are etched on its surface.\n\nFrequency: once per day\nYou cast blade barrier of the indicated level. Damage from the wall also exposes the damaged creature to a poison determined by the wand's type. The poison uses its normal DC. A creature can be exposed to the poison no more than once per turn.\n\nThe poison is dragon bile (Core Rulebook 551) with no onset."
    },
